        "original_id": "7e9b6e3a-468b-551b-8844-0685e88e0e0e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Josh Brolin, Nathan Summers, Spike Lee, Mark Protosevich, Elizabeth Olsen, Sharlto Copley\n- Characters: Cable\n- Organizations: Marvel Comics, X-Force, X-Men\n- Films: Deadpool 2, Oldboy\n- Topics: Casting, comic-book characters, film credits\n\nFacts:\n- Cable, also known as Nathan Summers, is a fictional character in American comic books published by Marvel Comics.\n- Cable is commonly associated with X-Force and the X-Men.\n- Oldboy is a 2013 film directed by Spike Lee and written by Mark Protosevich.\n- Oldboy stars Josh Brolin, Elizabeth Olsen, and Sharlto Copley.\n- In April 2017, Josh Brolin was cast as Nathan Summers / Cable in the X-Men film series.\n- Josh Brolin's casting as Cable was part of a four-film contract.\n- Josh Brolin's first intended appearance as Cable was in Deadpool 2.",
